 "description": "Check that a local library asset exists and is referenced by an optional manifest. The default static mode preserves the cheap filesystem check. Opt-in deep_roundtrip validates an absolute .tox in an authenticated disposable quarantine bridge on a non-9980 port, using a structured loadTox-only job with bounded polling and verified scratch cleanup; offline evidence is UNVERIFIED, never PASS.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
